      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "我々はあの方と共に、リベイラ村からダグシオンへと\n向かおうとしているのですが、巨人の冥界兵に遭遇し\n道を塞がれ、大変苦戦しております。\n急ぎ、冥界兵の排除を御願い致します！",
        "official_en": "While escorting a certain someone from Ribeira to\nDagsion, we were attacked by underworld giants.\nWe are fighting well, but lack the numbers to win.\nPlease hurry our way. We need reinforcements!",
        "real_en": null
      },
